:: OC Bobby Farm Help Out Barn Horse Care [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 25>>
You find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> in the stables brushing and caring for his steed, a nice looking horse with a long shining brown mane. The horse sees you first, snorting in your general direction as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> turns and chuckles. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! Don’t mind her, she just gets jealous easily.”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You carefully approach as the horse watches you suspiciously before turning its snout up at you.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Bobby",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
