    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha, come on girl, he’s a friend. Be nice.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> laughs, continuing to brush the horse’s mane. You ask if all his horses get this jealous and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> sighs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nope, just her. Brought a friend from school to see her once and she just about bit his jeans off. My friend was rather upset after that, haha.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You outwardly worry about the safety of your own bottoms, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> assures you that he’ll keep them safe.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Plus, you’re too short for her to reach.”</span> <br>
<br>
Once you are close enough, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> grabs your hand and carefully places it on the horse’s leg. You’re a bit scared at first, watching as the horse continues to glare at you, <span style="color:LightGreen">but finally she looks away, as if giving you permission to pet her, just this once. You smile and continue to stroke the horse’s fur as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Bobby</span> brushes her mane.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“She might be taking a liking to you.”</span> He smiles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe I can show you how to brush her hair sometime, once I’m sure she won’t bite your clothes off.”</span> You nod, you’d like that… <span style="color:Pink">as long as you don’t end up walking home in your underwear.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, I’d drive you home at least if she did do that.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m not THAT mean.”</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Bobby" 3 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 15>>
